The '''Lava Flame''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from {{Item|Lava}} on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
The '''Lava Flame''' can be fished up from {{Item|Lava}} anywhere in the Crimson Isle, with a [[Fishing Rods|Lava Fishing Rod]]. It requires {{Skill|fishing|33}} to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Lava Flame''' is {{Green|360}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|7.75%|1|12.91|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
